## 3. Project Title

Introduction to Artificial Intelligence

**Selected Topic:** Option A – AI Concepts & Trends (AI Overview)

## 4. Project Overview

This project focuses on introducing Artificial Intelligence (AI), explaining its basic concepts, characteristics, and applications in modern society.

It will provide an overview of how AI works and how it is used in everyday life, including education, healthcare, transportation, and business.

The project will also introduce the main benefits and limitations of Artificial Intelligence.

## 5. Project Objectives

- Explain the definition and basic concepts of Artificial Intelligence.
- Understand the main characteristics of AI.
- Introduce basic principles of how AI works.
- Explore examples of AI applications in everyday life.
- Identify the advantages and disadvantages of AI.

## 6. Project Scope

The project will focus on the following areas:

1. Definition and Introduction to AI.
2. Basic Characteristics of Artificial Intelligence.
3. How Artificial Intelligence Works.
4. Applications of AI in Everyday Life.
5. Advantages and Disadvantages of AI.

## 7. Methodology

The project will use a research-based approach.

Information will be collected from reliable educational websites, research publications, and official technology sources.

The team will:
- Research basic AI concepts.
- Collect relevant information and examples.
- Organize and analyze the collected information.
- Prepare a written project report.
- Create a PowerPoint presentation.

## 8. Expected Outcomes

- Develop a basic understanding of Artificial Intelligence.
- Understand how AI works and where it is used.
- Identify practical applications of AI.
- Understand the main benefits and limitations of AI.
- Present the research findings in a clear and organized format.

## 9. Final Deliverables

- Project proposal uploaded to GitHub.
- Final project report in MS Word format.
- Presentation slides in PowerPoint format.

## 10. Conclusion

This project aims to provide a clear and beginner-friendly introduction to Artificial Intelligence.

By exploring its basic concepts, characteristics, and everyday applications, the team will develop an understanding of the role of AI in modern society and its importance in different fields
